<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wedlock Account Activation</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: "Proxima Nova regular";
            src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Regular.otf') format("opentype");
            font-family: "Proxima Nova thin";
            src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Thin.otf') format("opentype");
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Proxima Nova regular", sans-serif;
            background-color: #F4F4F4;
        }

        p {
            font-family: Proxima Nova thin, sans-serif;
            color: #4D4D4D;
        }

    

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .main {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        #title {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 21.92px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #4D4D4D;
        }

        #name {
            color: black;
        }

        .content h3 {
            margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
            color: #007EAF;
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 48.72px;
        }

        .content p {
            margin: 2rem 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 24px;
        }

        .otp {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .otp div {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #007EAF;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: 2px solid #53ADAE;
            border-radius: 10px;
            min-width: 60px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        #char{
            margin-right: 20px;
        }

        #thakyou {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        a {
            color: #4D4D4D;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                padding: 10px;
            }

            .main {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }

            .content h3 {
                font-size: 32px;
                line-height: 38px;
            }

            .otp div {
                font-size: 32px;
                padding: 8px 16px;
                min-width: 50px;
            }
            

            .content p {
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 22px;
            }

            #title {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 400px) {
            .otp div {
                font-size: 28px;
                padding: 6px 12px;
                min-width: 40px;
            }
            #char{
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

            .content h3 {
                font-size: 28px;
                line-height: 34px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="main">
            <a href="https://www.wedlock.com.au">
                <img src="https://wedlock.com.au/wedlock-img.jpg" alt="Wedlock Logo" style="max-width: 300px;">
            </a>
            <div class="content">
                <h2 id="title">Welcome to <span id="name">Wedlock</span>!</h2>
                <h3>Confirmation code</h3>
                <p>Verify your new Wedlock account.</p>
                <p>To verify your email address, please use the following One Time Password (OTP):</p>
                <div class="otp">
                    <% activationCode.split('').forEach((char) => { %>
                        <div id="char"><%= char %></div>
                    <% }) %>
                </div>
                <p>Do not share this OTP with anyone. Wedlock takes your account security very seriously. Wedlock will never ask you to disclose or verify your Wedlock password, OTP, credit card, or banking account number. If you receive a suspicious email with a link to update your account information, do not click on the link - instead, report the email to Wedlock for investigation.</p>
                <p id="thakyou">Thank you!</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p>The Wedlock Team</p>
                <p><a href="https://wedlock.com.au">https://www.wedlock.com.au</a></p>
                <p>Copyright © 2025 Wedlock</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>